# The four CI checks, plus the build, before anything is committed.
#
# Same order as the pull request runs them in, cheapest first, so a missing
# semicolon is reported in a second rather than after a bundle. The build is
# here as well because it is the one step CI runs that `npm test` does not
# exercise at all: a renderer that fails to bundle typechecks perfectly.
#
# Together about six seconds. A hook slower than that is a hook people pass
# `--no-verify` to, which is the same as not having one.
npm run format:check
npm run lint
npm run build
npm test
